{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, take it: if heavy, move to location, scan properties, special task; else approach object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Condition ID = isObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecialTask    /> <Condition ID = IsLocationReached    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    />",
    "BT": {
